* ============================================================================
* Splunk SPL - GH/VPN campaign sweep
*
*   A. BoryptGrab-lineage infostealer  (fake GitHub repos)
*   B. QuickFox VPN supply chain       (FDMTP, Mustang Panda lineage)
*   C. "Free VPN for PC" GitHub repo   (Lumma Stealer)
*
* Author : Cristian Ruvalcaba and the Saluca Agentic AI Research Team
* Date   : 2026-08-10
* Ref    : README.md
*
* Assumes Sysmon via the Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Sysmon, sourcetype
* XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational. Adjust index=* to your
* Windows index. Where a CIM datamodel equivalent is obvious it is noted inline.
*
* Sysmon event IDs used: 1 process create, 3 network connect, 7 image load,
* 8 create remote thread, 10 process access, 11 file create, 13 registry set,
* 22 DNS query.
* ============================================================================


* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* SETUP - lookup tables. Create these once, then the searches below reference them.
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
